## "Am I competitive at [Company]?" — Multi-Position Flow

Read `context.md`, `reference/companies.md`, `reference/recruiting.md`, and `reference/resume.md` before starting.

1. Infer roles from `context.md`.
2. Draft a persona per position from `reference/companies.md` + `reference/recruiting.md` track expectations.
3. Spawn **@resume-grading** per position via Task (`grade · {year}/{company}/{role} · screen`) — blind to `context.md`.
4. Synthesize grades, calibrate against `TRACKER.md` scores and statuses, coach on what to improve — verdict-first bullets, not a full grade dump unless asked.

